This function produces a topAnatObject, ready to use for gene set enrichment testing. On the expression calls observed in each condition, it is an object of the topGO package, that uses the Uberon ontology instead of the GO ontology. On the expression calls propagated by Bgee, from Bgee 16, BgeeDB runs the classic Fisher test on it itself, without topGO.
